GROWTH IS A CURVE WITH A PEAK, NOT A SLOPE

    book                                       Sharpe  best vol  best growth   zero at
    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    SPY, the real market (R48)                   0.55      55%       15.3%      111%
    equal-weight survivors, measured             0.93      93%       43.1%      186%
    what 20%/yr at a 30% budget needs (R57)      1.70     170%      144.5%      340%
    Sharpe 2.0 (R48's 20% at 10% vol)            2.00     200%      200.0%      400%

    Past twice the Sharpe in volatility the growth rate is NEGATIVE, whatever the
    strategy. That is the part of 'as much as possible' that is simply wrong.

