AND WHAT A SURVIVABLE DRAWDOWN BUDGET ALLOWS INSTEAD

    Budget: the drawdown 5% of healthy 27-year histories reach, set at 30%.

    book                                       full Kelly  1/4 Kelly   budget  budget vs 1/4
    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    SPY, the real market (R48)                       55%        14%       7%          0.52x
    equal-weight survivors, measured                 93%        23%      10%          0.41x
    what 20%/yr at a 30% budget needs (R57)         170%        42%      13%          0.30x
    Sharpe 2.0 (R48's 20% at 10% vol)               200%        50%      13%          0.27x

    Every row: the budget allows a FRACTION of even quarter Kelly. The growth-optimal
    sizing literature does not bind here at any Sharpe this project can reach -- the
    drawdown budget does, and by a wide margin. Optimal sizing is not the question.

